{
  "Name": "DGR 024 - ASTRA",
  "Source": "Zagalhtas Exolunar Collection",
  "Group": "DGR Frame Units",
  "Information": "**DGR 024 - ASTRA**\n\nThe ASTRA unit is a versatile combat unit designed to be deployed by type as it has a number of variants with different elemental affinities. Each type possesses slightly different features, coming in the variants described below, with the traits listed for each.\n\n**Corrosion ASTRA.** Its elemental damage type is acid. It has a burrow speed equal to its fly speed and deals double damage to vehicles and structures.\n\n**Inferno ASTRA.** Its elemental damage type is fire. It can retaliate against nearby melee attackers with its Hellfire Shield.\n\n**Tundral ASTRA.** Its elemental damage type is cold. Its Freezing Aura turns nearby spaces into difficult terrain for creatures not resistant or immune to cold.\n\n**Void ASTRA.** Its elemental damage type is force. Its Fly-By movement applies to its 0-G acceleration speed.\n\n**Wind ASTRA.** Its elemental damage type is lightning. Its fly speed is doubled and it has the Fly-By trait.",
  "Image": "https://pub-bf21913a9572403eaaeb529e5bc42880.r2.dev/monsters/CR8/DGR%20024%20-%20ASTRA.png",
